<h3><u>GUNJTI SHAAME GARIBAAN MEIN</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><h1>GUNJTI SHAAME GARIBAAN MEIN</h1>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>GUNJTI SHAAME GARIBAAN MEIN YEH ZAINAB KI SADAA, MERA KOI NA RAHA</p>

<p>NA RAHE BHAI NA BETE, CHIN GAYI MERI RIDA, MERA KOI NA RAHA.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>AASRE DEKE BAHEN CHOD KE AAYI THI WATAN</p>

<p>MERE PARDE KA JISE MAA NE BANAYA THA AMAN</p>

<p>LABE DARIYA MERE GHAZI&nbsp; KE HUE BAAZU JUDA</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>WOH JO ATHAARA BARAS NOORI HIJABON MEIN RAHA</p>

<p>LAUT KE AAOONGA MAIN JISNE THA SUGRA SE KAHA</p>

<p>HAAYE BARCHI SE KALEJA, MERE AKBAR KA CHIDA</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>MERA GHAZI BHI GAYA QASIM O AKBAR BHI GAYE</p>

<p>HURR SA MEHMAAN BHI GAYA IBNE MAZAAHIR BHI GAYE</p>

<p>KISKO GURBAT MEIN SADAA DOON, KARBALA YEH TOH BATAA</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>MAA NE MAQTAL MEIN JISE DULHA BANAKAR BHEJA</p>

<p>MERE QASIM KA BADAN DASHT MEIN PAMAAL HUA</p>

<p>BAAL KHOLE HUE ROTI, HUI LAASHE SE KAHA</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>WOH SAKINA KE JISE PYAAR THA BABA SE BADAA</p>

<p>BAAD BABA KE MILI JISKO TAMACHON KI SAZAA</p>

<p>BURZ JO ZAALIM NE UTAARE, KHOON AANKHON SE BAHAA</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>
</p>